<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body>
    <p>Hello <%= @name %>,</p>
    <p>Greetings from BirdChime!</p>
    <p>We are glad to provide you with our biggest feature update.</p>
    <strong>Ability To Book Time During Purchase</strong>
    <p>
      For the past few weeks we have been getting numerous requests from our
      merchants to allow their clients to book during purchase instead of an
      email and after a week worth of effort we are glad to bring you the
      feature. Now your clients can directly book from your store. They will not
      have to wait for an email or leave your store to complete their purchase.
    </p>

    <p>
      We have also made a video to help you understand the process better.
      <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=csA0AKtl0zE" target="_blank"
        >Click here to watch the video!</a
      >.
    </p>
    <p>
      We hope this feature will simplify the process of rocking your store.
      we hope to have a long term-relationship with <%=
      @shop_name %>, If you have any questions, feel free to reach out to us
      anytime.
      <a href="<%= @crisp_url %>" target="_blank">Chat with us!</a>
    </p>
    <p>Regards,</p>
    <p>BirdChime Team</p>
  </body>
</html>
